************ SPECIAL FORMATTED COMMENT **********
EW API FORMATTED COMMENT
TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY getlist

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK details.html

LINK_NAME Sample Config File
LINK getlist.d.txt

LINK_NAME Programmer Notes
LINK programmer_notes.txt

DESCRIPTION "getlist" is a cgi-bin program that generates
customized maps of earthquakes.  A list of events(earthquakes) 
is retrieved from an EWDB, and then  a web page that lists 
all of the retrieved  events(in both text-list and 
graphical-map form), along with summary information for 
each event, is created.  It contains links
to other programs that provide detailed information for a
chosen event.  In certain modes getlist will also display
stations on the same map as the events.
<br><br>

